0 Fixture: Small Angular Motor driving a tipping seed bay.
0 Expected: clean. In the closed pose the tray is horizontal and the red
0 ball sits between three low walls. A quarter-turn tips the tray so the
0 seed rolls through its open edge. This is mechanically simpler than a
0 trap door and does not need a belt, spring, or third port.
0
0 The tray is a multi-part moving subassembly on one powered axis.
0 !LDRCHECK PIVOT 3706.dat +X
